{"id":"vorsitzender","lemma":"Vorsitzender","pos":"noun","rank":4182,"glosses":["chairman, chairperson, chair, board chairman (male or of unspecified gender)","president (male or of unspecified gender)"],"ipa":"/ˈfoːɐ̯ˌzɪt͡sn̩dɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/50/De-Vorsitzender.ogg/De-Vorsitzender.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Vorsitzenden","plural":"Vorsitzende","feminine":"Vorsitzende"},"examples":[{"text":"Der Vorsitzende schnitt mir das Wort ab.","en":"The chairperson cut me short.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to cut","l":"schneiden"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"word as an isolated unit"},{"g":"beginning at that time…"}]},{"text":"Er ist der Vorsitzende des Komitees.","en":"He's the chairman of the committee.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"of the","l":"der"},{"g":"committee","l":"Komitee"}]},{"text":"Alle hören dem Vorsitzenden zu.","en":"Everyone is listening to the chairperson.","words":[{"g":"all, everyone"},{"g":"to hear through the ear)"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"to / too"}]},{"text":"Der Vorsitzende wird zurücktreten.","en":"The chairman is going to resign.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"to step back"}]},{"text":"Er hat mit dem Vorsitzenden gesprochen.","en":"He talked to the chairman.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"to speak","l":"sprechen"}]}]}